<section class="section">
  <div class="rte wrap">
    {%- if page.content != blank -%}
      {{ page.content }}
    {%- elsif section.settings.body != blank -%}
      {{ section.settings.body }}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign support_email = shop.email | default: 'hello@glaze.shop' -%}
      {%- assign updated = 'now' | date: '%B %Y' -%}
      {%- case page.handle -%}

        {%- when 'terms-of-service' -%}
          <p><em>Last updated: {{ updated }}</em></p>
          <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the {{ shop.name }} website (the "Site") and your purchase of any products from us. By browsing the Site or placing an order, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.</p>

          <h3>1. Who can use the Site</h3>
          <p>You must be at least 18 years old, or the age of majority in your place of residence, to place an order. By ordering, you confirm that the information you provide is accurate and that you are legally able to enter into this agreement.</p>

          <h3>2. Our products</h3>
          <p>{{ shop.name }} sells cosmetic skincare products, including the Pink Collagen Glow Balm. Our products are cosmetics, not medicines. Any statements about the products describe the look, feel and appearance of skin and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any condition. Individual results vary. Always read the label, patch test before first use, and discontinue use if irritation occurs. Any third-party brand names or trademarks referenced are the property of their respective owners and do not imply endorsement.</p>

          <h3>3. Orders and acceptance</h3>
          <p>Your order is an offer to buy. All orders are subject to acceptance and availability — we may refuse, limit or cancel any order (for example, where a product is out of stock, where we suspect fraud, or where a pricing or description error has occurred). A contract is formed only when we send you an order confirmation or dispatch your order. We may limit quantities purchased per person, per household or per order.</p>

          <h3>4. Pricing and payment</h3>
          <p>Prices are shown on the Site and may change at any time before you order. Prices are exclusive of taxes and shipping unless stated; applicable taxes and shipping are calculated at checkout. You authorise us and our payment processor to charge your chosen payment method for the total amount of your order. If a product is listed at an incorrect price due to an error, we may cancel the order and refund any amount paid.</p>

          <h3>5. Discounts and promotions</h3>
          <p>Discount codes and promotions are subject to their own terms, can't be combined unless we say so, have no cash value, and may be changed or withdrawn at any time. Bundle and "buy more, save more" pricing applies only while the offer is live.</p>

          <h3>6. Shipping, returns and refunds</h3>
          <p>Delivery is covered by our Shipping &amp; Returns policy, and returns and refunds are covered by our Refund Policy. Risk of loss and title for products pass to you upon delivery to the carrier or to your address, as applicable.</p>

          <h3>7. Intellectual property</h3>
          <p>All content on the Site — including text, graphics, logos, images, product photography and design — is owned by or licensed to {{ shop.name }} and is protected by intellectual property laws. We grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to access the Site for personal, non-commercial use. You may not copy, reproduce, scrape, republish or exploit any content without our prior written permission.</p>

          <h3>8. Acceptable use</h3>
          <p>You agree not to use the Site for any unlawful purpose, to interfere with its operation or security, to introduce malicious code, or to attempt to gain unauthorised access to any part of the Site or its systems.</p>

          <h3>9. Third-party links</h3>
          <p>The Site may contain links to third-party websites or services that we do not control. We are not responsible for their content, policies or practices, and your use of them is at your own risk.</p>

          <h3>10. Disclaimers</h3>
          <p>The Site and products are provided "as is" and "as available" to the fullest extent permitted by law. We do not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted or error-free. Because cosmetics affect people differently, we make no guarantee of specific results.</p>

          <h3>11. Limitation of liability</h3>
          <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, {{ shop.name }} and its team will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special or consequential damages arising from your use of the Site or products. Where liability cannot be excluded, our total liability is limited to the amount you paid for the order giving rise to the claim. Nothing in these Terms limits your statutory consumer rights or any liability that cannot be excluded by law.</p>

          <h3>12. Indemnification</h3>
          <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless {{ shop.name }} from any claims, losses or expenses arising out of your breach of these Terms or misuse of the Site.</p>

          <h3>13. Governing law and disputes</h3>
          <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the jurisdiction in which {{ shop.name }} operates, without regard to conflict-of-law rules. Before bringing any formal claim, you agree to contact us first so we can try to resolve the matter informally.</p>

          <h3>14. Changes to these Terms</h3>
          <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. The version posted on this page is the current one, and changes take effect when posted. Your continued use of the Site after changes means you accept the updated Terms.</p>

          <h3>15. Contact us</h3>
          <p>Questions about these Terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a>.</p>
          <p class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem">This policy is a template provided as a starting point. Please review it with a qualified professional and adapt it to your business and local laws before relying on it.</p>

        {%- when 'privacy-policy' -%}
          <p><em>Last updated: {{ updated }}</em></p>
          <p>{{ shop.name }} ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what personal information we collect, how we use and share it, and the choices you have. It applies to the {{ shop.name }} website and related sales channels.</p>

          <h3>1. Information we collect</h3>
          <p><strong>Information you give us:</strong> name, email address, shipping and billing address, phone number, order and payment details (processed securely by our payment provider — we never store full card numbers), and any messages you send us.</p>
          <p><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong> device and browser type, IP address, pages viewed, referring links and similar usage data, gathered through cookies and similar technologies (including our ecommerce platform and analytics tools).</p>
          <p><strong>Information from third parties:</strong> our payment processor, shipping carriers, and marketing or advertising partners may share limited information with us to help fulfil orders, prevent fraud and improve our marketing.</p>

          <h3>2. How we use your information</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>To process, fulfil and deliver your orders and provide customer support.</li>
            <li>To take payment and protect against fraud and abuse.</li>
            <li>To send you transactional messages about your orders.</li>
            <li>To send marketing — restock alerts, offers and news — where you have opted in. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
            <li>To operate, analyse and improve the Site and our products.</li>
            <li>To meet our legal, tax and accounting obligations.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>3. Legal bases for processing</h3>
          <p>Where the GDPR or similar laws apply, we process your data on the basis of: performance of our contract with you (to fulfil orders), your consent (for marketing and certain cookies), our legitimate interests (to run and improve the business and prevent fraud), and compliance with legal obligations.</p>

          <h3>4. Cookies and tracking</h3>
          <p>We use cookies and similar technologies to keep the Site working, remember your cart, understand how the Site is used, and — with your consent where required — to measure and personalise marketing. You can control cookies through your browser settings; disabling some cookies may affect how the Site works.</p>

          <h3>5. How we share information</h3>
          <p>We share personal information only with: service providers who help us run the shop (our ecommerce platform, payment processors, shipping carriers, email and analytics providers); authorities or advisors where required by law or to protect our rights; and a successor entity in the event of a merger, acquisition or sale of assets. <strong>We do not sell your personal information.</strong></p>

          <h3>6. Data retention</h3>
          <p>We keep personal information only for as long as needed to fulfil the purposes described here, including to meet legal, tax and reporting requirements, after which it is deleted or anonymised.</p>

          <h3>7. Security</h3>
          <p>We use appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

          <h3>8. Your rights</h3>
          <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, delete or receive a copy of your personal information, to object to or restrict certain processing, and to withdraw consent. If you are in California, you may have the right to know, delete and opt out of "sale/share" of personal information, and not to be discriminated against for exercising those rights. To make a request, email <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a>; we may need to verify your identity.</p>

          <h3>9. International transfers</h3>
          <p>Your information may be processed in countries other than where you live, including by our service providers. Where required, we put safeguards in place to protect it.</p>

          <h3>10. Children's privacy</h3>
          <p>The Site is not intended for children, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under 16. If you believe a child has provided us information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

          <h3>11. Marketing choices</h3>
          <p>You can opt out of marketing emails at any time using the unsubscribe link in any message or by contacting us. We will still send you essential messages about your orders.</p>

          <h3>12. Changes to this policy</h3>
          <p>We may update this policy from time to time; the version on this page is current and changes take effect when posted.</p>

          <h3>13. Contact us</h3>
          <p>For any privacy question or request, email <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a>.</p>
          <p class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem">This policy is a template provided as a starting point. Please review it with a qualified professional and adapt it to your business and local laws (such as GDPR or CCPA) before relying on it.</p>

        {%- when 'refund-policy' -%}
          <p><em>Last updated: {{ updated }}</em></p>
          <p>We want you glazed and happy. If something isn't right, here's how returns and refunds work. This policy is offered in addition to your statutory consumer rights, which it does not affect.</p>

          <h3>1. 30-day returns</h3>
          <p>You can return eligible items within <strong>30 days</strong> of delivery for a refund of the product price. Because we'd rather you actually test the balm, opened and gently used items are fine to return within this window, provided they're in otherwise resalable condition.</p>

          <h3>2. How to start a return</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Email <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a> with your order number and the item(s) you'd like to return.</li>
            <li>We'll reply with return instructions and, where applicable, a prepaid return label.</li>
            <li>Pack the item securely and send it back using the instructions provided. Please don't send items back before contacting us.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>3. Refunds</h3>
          <p>Once we receive and inspect your return, we'll email you to confirm. Approved refunds are issued to your original payment method, typically within <strong>5–10 business days</strong> (your bank or card provider may take additional time to post it).</p>

          <h3>4. Exchanges</h3>
          <p>Need a different item? The fastest way is to return your original order for a refund and place a new order. If you'd prefer a direct exchange, contact us and we'll help.</p>

          <h3>5. Damaged, defective or wrong items</h3>
          <p>If your order arrives damaged, faulty or incorrect, contact us within <strong>7 days</strong> of delivery with your order number and a photo. We'll arrange a replacement or refund — usually with no need to send the item back.</p>

          <h3>6. Return shipping costs</h3>
          <p>If the return is due to our error or a faulty item, we cover return shipping. For change-of-mind returns, a prepaid label fee may be deducted from your refund, which we'll confirm before you send anything back.</p>

          <h3>7. Non-returnable items</h3>
          <p>Gift cards and items marked "final sale" are non-refundable. Original shipping charges (if any) are non-refundable except where the return is due to our error.</p>

          <h3>8. Late or missing refunds</h3>
          <p>If you haven't received a refund after the timeframe above, first check with your bank or card provider, then contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a> and we'll chase it up.</p>

          <h3>9. Gifts</h3>
          <p>If the item was marked as a gift and shipped directly to you, we can issue a gift credit once the return is received.</p>

          <h3>10. Contact us</h3>
          <p>Questions about a return? Email <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a>.</p>
          <p class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem">This policy is a template provided as a starting point. Please review it and align it with your Shopify policy settings and local consumer laws before relying on it.</p>

        {%- when 'shipping-returns' -%}
          <p><em>Last updated: {{ updated }}</em></p>
          <p>Here's everything about how your order gets to you, and how returns work.</p>

          <h3>1. Order processing</h3>
          <p>Orders are processed and dispatched within <strong>1–2 business days</strong>. Orders placed on weekends or holidays are processed the next business day. You'll receive a confirmation email when you order and a shipping email with tracking once it's on the way.</p>

          <h3>2. Shipping rates</h3>
          <p>Enjoy <strong>free standard shipping on orders over ${{ settings.free_shipping_threshold }}</strong> and on every trio (3-pack). Orders below the threshold ship at a flat rate shown at checkout. Final shipping options and costs are calculated at checkout based on your address.</p>

          <h3>3. Delivery estimates</h3>
          <p>Standard domestic delivery typically takes 3–7 business days after dispatch, depending on your location and carrier. These are estimates, not guarantees — delivery times can vary during sales, holidays and peak periods.</p>

          <h3>4. Order tracking</h3>
          <p>As soon as your order ships, we'll email you a tracking link so you can follow it to your door.</p>

          <h3>5. International shipping</h3>
          <p>Where international shipping is offered, delivery times vary by destination and customs processing. Any import duties, taxes or customs fees are the responsibility of the recipient and are not included in our prices or shipping charges.</p>

          <h3>6. Address accuracy</h3>
          <p>Please double-check your shipping address at checkout. We're not able to cover the cost of reshipping orders returned to us due to an incorrect or incomplete address, though we'll always help where we can.</p>

          <h3>7. Delays, lost or stolen packages</h3>
          <p>Once an order is handed to the carrier, delivery is in their hands and we can't control carrier delays. If tracking shows delivered but you can't find your parcel, check with neighbours and your carrier first, then contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a> and we'll help investigate or file a claim.</p>

          <h3>8. Returns</h3>
          <p>Not glowing? You can return your balm within <strong>30 days</strong> of delivery for a refund — see our Refund Policy for full details and how to start a return.</p>

          <h3>9. Contact us</h3>
          <p>Shipping questions? Email <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a>.</p>
          <p class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem">This policy is a template provided as a starting point. Please review it and align it with your carriers, rates and local laws before relying on it.</p>

        {%- else -%}
          <p>Add this page's content in the page editor (Online Store → Pages), or in this section's Body field in the theme editor.</p>
      {%- endcase -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Page content",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Body content (used when the page itself has no content)" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
